--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Cys's UI - Wowhead's WoW Forever pre-raid BiS lists (data for Cys's BiS)
--
-- Read by hand from Wowhead's "<Spec> Best in Slot Gear - WoW: Forever" guides on 24 Nov 2026
-- (wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/<class>/<spec>/bis-gear). Pre-raid picks only: raid loot
-- (Barrow Deeps, Hyjal Summit, Onyxia) is left out. Where a guide has no summary table, its top
-- non-raid item per slot is used. Empty slots = the guide lists nothing there yet.
--
-- Entry: { itemID, "Name", "Where from", h = { hordeItemID, "Horde name" } }   (h only for faction pairs)
-- Slots: head neck shoulder back chest wrist hands waist legs feet ring1 ring2 trinket1 trinket2
--        main off two ranged   ("two" = the two-hander the guide lists instead of main + off hand)
-- Cys's BiS also matches by name, because some guides still link a Classic ID for a T0.5 piece.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
